            "name": "XYZ tiles",
            "description": {
              "content": "The individual tiles. Can be used with various libraries to display the tiles (e.g. Leaflet, OpenLayers, ...). It's usually better (if possible) to use the TileJSON rather than using the tile URL directly.",
